We use useMemo whenever we have to store/cache result/value of aur calculation while useCallback can store/cache/freeze any function reference.

By using useCallback,we can stop the recreation of function or want to call it on dependency change.
Remember,useMemo k zariye ap value/result ko memoize/store krty thy aur function k re run ko rok lty thy while in useCallback,is me ap function k reference ko memoize krty ha aur function ko re creation sy rukty ha(It does not stop function re run,it stop recreation) 
We use useCallback in two scenarios

1)When we have to prevent un necessary re renders of child components

